<div class="rounded-3 d-flex">
  <div class="d-flex me-3">
    <i class="material-icons text-secondary point" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#write_modal">
      info
    </i>
    <strong class="text-primary fs-5">WRITE</strong>
  </div>

  <form id="writeForm" action="/vocab/write" method="POST" class="menuitem d-flex justify-content-end w-100">

    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-end">
      <div class="form-check me-3">
        <input id="L1" class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="L1">
        <label class="form-check-label small" for="L1">
          L1
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="form-check me-3">
        <input id="trace" class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="trace" checked>
        <label class="form-check-label small" for="trace">
          Trace
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="form-check me-3">
        <input id="write" class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="write" checked>
        <label class="form-check-label small" for="write">
          Write
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <input type="hidden" value="" name="deckType">
    <input type="hidden" value="" name="deck">
    <button id="writeButton" type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" style="height:100%;">Start</button>
  </form>

</div>


<div id="write_modal" class="modal fade">
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-content">

      <div class="modal-header">
        <h3 class="modal-title">Writing Practice</h3>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>Print pages for students to practice writing in various ways.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use <strong>L1 / Trace</strong> to show meaning and trace the English.<br />
            <span class="NHline display-6" style="display:inline;">なぞる</span>
            <span class="NHdot display-6" style="display:inline;">&nbsp;trace</span>
            <br /><br />
          </li>
          <li>Add <strong>Write</strong> to let them try writing it on their own.<br />
            <span class="NHline display-6" style="display:inline;">習う</span>
            <span class="NHdot display-6" style="display:inline;">&nbsp;learn|||||||||||||||||</span>
            <br /><br />
          </li>
          <li>Use <strong>Trace / Write</strong> if they already know the meaning.<br />
            <span class="NHdot display-6" style="display:inline;">&nbsp;use|||||||||||||||||||||||||</span>
            <br /><br />
          </li>
          <li>Use <strong>L1 / Write</strong> to give them a quiz.<br />
            <span class="NHline display-6" style="display:inline;">クイズ</span>
            <span class="NHdot display-6" style="display:inline;">&nbsp;|||||||||||||||||||||</span>
            <br /><br />
          </li>
          <li>Or just use <strong>Write</strong> for some lined paper to practice on.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>